UXDOS16 V0.1.0
For the Commander X16
>>RUN CMDSHELL.COM
C>PATH$ = "C:\DOS"
C>XCOPY MANY MANY\SUB.DIR\BAK -s
Cannot copy a directory into itself
C>FILES MANY\SUB.DIR
.                 <DIR>
..                <DIR>
INNER             <DIR>
     3 File(s)
C>XCOPY MANY\SUB.DIR NEW\TREE -s
C:\MANY\SUB.DIR\INNER\DEEP.TXT
     1 File(s) copied
C>TREE NEW -F

\NEW
 +- TREE
     +- INNER
            DEEP.TXT
            
C>XCOPY MANY\*.ZZZ BAK -s
File not found
     0 File(s) copied
C>XCOPY MANY\SUB.DIR -sl
C:\MANY\SUB.DIR\INNER\DEEP.TXT
     1 File(s)
C>MKDIR E1
C>MKDIR E1\E2
C>MKDIR E1\E2\E3
C>XCOPY E1 E4 -e
File not found
     0 File(s) copied
C>TREE E4

\E4
 +- E2
     +- E3
